    "evidence_text": "Don S. Davis\n\n He was also a theater professor, painter, and United States Army captain.\n\nEpisode 8 (Twin Peaks)\n\nSamantha Carter\n\n Carter also appears in two episodes of Season 1 of \"Stargate Universe.\"\n\nStargate: Continuum\n\n It is the second sequel to television series \"Stargate SG-1\" following \"\".\n\nLost City (Stargate SG-1)\n\n \"Lost City\" also featured special guest star Chief of Staff of the Air Force John P. Jumper as himself.\n\nStargate SG-1 (season 8)\n\n Season eight regular cast members include Richard Dean Anderson, Amanda Tapping, Christopher Judge, and Michael Shanks.\n\nStargate SG-1\n\n The television series was filmed in and around the city of Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada.\n\nRedemption (Stargate SG-1)\n\n The episode was written by producer Robert C. Cooper, and directed by Martin Wood.\n\n The episode also marks the second appearance of David Hewlett's character Rodney McKay, who later became a main character on \"Stargate Atlantis\".\n\nVala Mal Doran\n\nGeorge Hammond (Stargate)\n\n is a fictional character in the \"Stargate franchise\".",
